  "reviewed_solution": "设所求的二次函数解析式为 $y = a(x-1)^2 + 4$（$a \\neq 0$）\n把 $B(0,3)$ 代入得 $3 = a(0-1)^2 + 4$，解得 $a = -1$\n令 $y = 0$，那么 $-(x-1)^2 + 4 = 0$，解得 $x_1 = 3$，$x_2 = -1$\n$\\therefore CD = 4$\n在 $\\triangle BCD$ 中，$S_{\\triangle BCD} = \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot CD \\cdot OB = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 4 \\times 3 = 6$",
